  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Gothic Crossbow\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Gothic_Crossbow.png\" title=\"Gothic Crossbow\"><img alt=\"Gothic Crossbow\" border=\"0\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-ranged-_Gothic_Crossbow.png\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Piercing\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Two-Handed Ranged\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Normal\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client weapon speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client damage coeff:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">0.51\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Gothic Crossbow</b> is listed on the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-ranger\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-ranger\">Two-Handed-ranger</a> weapon list. Stats on this page come from the old weapon lists.</p>\n<p>This weapon also exists in other materials (Cardboard Gothic Crossbow, Celestial Gothic Crossbow, Diamond Gothic Crossbow, Iron Gothic Crossbow, Obsidian Gothic Crossbow, Stone Gothic Crossbow, Tin Gothic Crossbow, Titanium Gothic Crossbow, …).</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
